        "da_id": "IS1008a.C.dialog-act.s9553330.38",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "Uh <vocalsound> are there other people who will be contributing to the plan ?",
        "participant": "FIE073",
        "role": "ID"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.71",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "Yes , of course ,",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.72",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "if you need some help , uh so let me know .",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.73",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "So , who are the people you need uh from the marketing or uh the technical side or uh the administration point of view , okay , to add in any documentation , or some technical point of view ,",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.C.dialog-act.s9553330.39",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "<vocalsound>",
        "participant": "FIE073",
        "role": "ID"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.74",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "so just let me know so I can uh coordinate all the teams .",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.C.dialog-act.s9553330.40",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "Okay , I'll get back to you on that .",
        "participant": "FIE073",
        "role": "ID"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.70",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM",
        "text": "then we can have the further discussion again ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.75",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM",
        "text": "Yes ."
      }
    ],
    "peer_items": [
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#0",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "ID(FIE073) will deliver a written plan covering functional and technical design, staffing, timeframe, budget, and market plan by two weeks."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#1",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "Ed will coordinate with Christine to discuss cost and the sales plan as part of preparing the overall plan."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#2",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "ID(FIE073) did not understand the project goal and believed the project was a different product, indicating a scope/goal misalignment."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#3",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "There is no written project plan or budget yet, and documentation is missing to present to management."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#4",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The group decided that the project will focus on designing a remote control for television and will start with that remote control as the first product."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#5",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "The project manager will send a copy of the slides to all attendees at the conclusion of the meeting."
      }
